  "distinctTransforms": {
    "note": "Six of the eighteen movements are the same 3D transform at different magnitudes and with different rig intent: dolly-in / tracking-forward / push-in all translate camera-local -Z, and dolly-out / tracking-back / pull-out all translate +Z. The vocabulary has twelve distinct transforms, not eighteen. Previs makes that visible; the prompt layer cannot, because a text token for each reads as a different shot.",
    "forward": [
      "dolly-in",
      "tracking-forward",
      "push-in"
    ],
